    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "The new game's first moment, before nvfnew's facts (intro.actions.json starts there): VCG00 runs (Start Game Enabled) with no stage done, and the game is in a menu (a menu open stands for the pack plugins' message boxes of nvfnew; the packs are not loaded here). VCG00's MenuMode block sets stage 0 while its stage is below 5; stage 0's result script moves the player to the opening's start marker, plays the intro film (PlayBink, a recorded call headless), sets the hour and weather and jumps to stage 90 (the wake-up at Doc Mitchell's), which starts VCG00's 3 s countdown. The cemetery stages 5-85 are never reached this way (docs/spec-notes/bink-films.md)."
